{
  "info": {
    "name": "Monitoring Memorandum (IDMS)",
    "description": "Collection API untuk modul Dashboard Monitoring Memorandum — pencatatan issue operasional dari nota dinas, notifikasi (OSNO/NOPR), work order (50/60), purchase order, sampai status open/close.\n\n**Base URL**\nDefault `{{baseUrl}}` = `http://127.0.0.1:8000` (`php artisan serve`). Kalau memakai Laragon, ganti ke `http://localhost/idms_be/public`.\n\n**Endpoint (7)**\n- `GET    /api/monitoring_memorandum` — list + search + filter + sort + paginate\n- `POST   /api/monitoring_memorandum` — create\n- `GET    /api/monitoring_memorandum/{id}` — detail\n- `PUT    /api/monitoring_memorandum/{id}` — update (boleh parsial)\n- `DELETE /api/monitoring_memorandum/{id}` — delete\n- `GET    /api/monitoring_memorandum/export` — export xlsx (mengikuti filter aktif)\n- `GET    /api/monitoring_memorandum/dashboard` — agregat bobot per tahun + backlog per bucket\n\n**Khusus modul ini**\n- Semua endpoint butuh token (`auth:api`). Kirim header `Accept: application/json` supaya respons 401 berupa JSON.\n- Wajib diisi saat create HANYA `tanggal_issue` dan `issue_operasional`. Field lain nullable.\n- `tanggal_issue` tidak boleh di masa depan; `backlog_days` dihitung otomatis (minimal 0, tidak disimpan di DB).\n- `tag_number_ids` adalah string daftar ID dipisah koma, mis. `43,44`, ATAU literal `all` sebagai penanda All Tag Number. Tidak ada kolom boolean terpisah.\n- `search=all` TIDAK menemukan baris bertanda `all` (sentinel sengaja tidak ikut di-search). Filter `?tag_number_ids=all` menemukannya. Filter numerik `?tag_number_ids=43` TIDAK ikut menyertakan baris `all`.\n- Update parsial: kirim hanya field yang mau diubah. `{\"nota_dinas\": null}` mengosongkan nilai.\n- Bobot dashboard: nota dinas 10, no notif 10, status notif 20, no WO 10, status WO 20, no PO 10, status `close` 20 — dirata-rata per tahun.\n- Backlog dashboard: empat bucket tetap `1–30`, `31–60`, `61–90`, `91+`.\n- Bentuk respons: index → `{success, message, data:[...], meta:{...}}`; show → `{data:{...}}`; store/update → `{success, message, data:{...}}` (store: 201); delete → `{success, message}`; error validasi → 422 `{success:false, message:\"Validation failed.\", errors:{...}}`.\n\n**Urutan pakai**\nJalankan folder 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5. Folder 6 membersihkan data uji yang dibuat collection ini dan melakukan logout.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "list_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "created_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "created_multi_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "created_all_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tag_multi", "value": "43,44", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tag_satu", "value": "43", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tag_invalid", "value": "999999", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "nota_dinas_id", "value": "18", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Autentikasi",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (ambil token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('sukses + token ada', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin1\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "login"]
            },
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "description": "Simpan JWT ke variabel collection `token` (dan environment `token`) lewat test script — request berikutnya otomatis memakainya."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Tanpa token → 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('pesan Unauthenticated', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.eql('Unauthenticated.');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_memorandum?per_page=1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_memorandum"],
              "query": [{ "key": "per_page", "value": "1" }]
            },
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "description": "Membuktikan proteksi `auth:api`. Header `Accept: application/json` penting supaya respons 401 berupa JSON, bukan halaman HTML."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. List & Filter",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List (per_page 25, simpan id pertama)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('punya data[] + meta', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.meta).to.have.property('total');",
                  "});",
                  "if (Array.isArray(json.data) && json.data.length) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('list_id', json.data[0].id);",
                  "    console.log('list_id =', json.data[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_memorandum?per_page=25&sort_by=tanggal_issue&sort_order=desc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_memorandum"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "per_page", "value": "25" },
                { "key": "sort_by", "value": "tanggal_issue" },
                { "key": "sort_order", "value": "desc" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sort whitelist: `id`, `tanggal_issue`, `issue_operasional`, `tag_number_ids`, `nota_dinas`, `no_notif`, `status_notif`, `no_wo`, `status_wo`, `no_po`, `status`, `backlog_days`, `created_at`, `updated_at`. Default `tanggal_issue` desc."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Filter tag_number_ids=43 (tidak boleh termasuk baris all)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('semua baris memuat 43 dan bukan sentinel all', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    json.data.forEach((row) => {",
                  "        pm.expect(row.is_all_tag_number).to.eql(false);",
                  "        pm.expect(String(row.tag_number_ids).split(',')).to.include('43');",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_memorandum?tag_number_ids={{tag_satu}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_memorandum"],
              "query": [{ "key": "tag_number_ids", "value": "{{tag_satu}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Filter numerik memakai ANY: `43,44` mencocokkan baris yang memuat salah satu ID. Baris dengan `tag_number_ids = all` sengaja TIDAK ikut."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Filter tag_number_ids=all (hanya baris all)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('semua baris bertanda all', () => {",
                  "    json.data.forEach((row) => {",
                  "        pm.expect(row.is_all_tag_number).to.eql(true);",
                  "        pm.expect(row.tag_number_ids).to.eql('all');",
                  "        pm.expect(row.tag_numbers).to.be.an('array').that.is.empty;",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_memorandum?tag_number_ids=all",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_memorandum"],
              "query": [{ "key": "tag_number_ids", "value": "all" }]
            },
            "description": "Satu-satunya cara menemukan baris All Tag Number lewat filter."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search=all → sentinel TIDAK muncul",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('tidak ada baris all di hasil search', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    json.data.forEach((row) => pm.expect(row.is_all_tag_number).to.eql(false));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_memorandum?search=all",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_memorandum"],
              "query": [{ "key": "search", "value": "all" }]
            },
            "description": "Kolom `tag_number_ids` sengaja tidak termasuk global search, jadi kata `all` tidak boleh menemukan baris sentinel lewat field ini. Boleh ada hasil kalau teks 'all' muncul di field lain (mis. issue_operasional) — pengujian memastikan bukan baris sentinel."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Filter backlog_days_min=91",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('semua backlog_days >= 91', () => {",
                  "    json.data.forEach((row) => pm.expect(row.backlog_days).to.be.at.least(91));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_memorandum?backlog_days_min=91",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_memorandum"],
              "query": [{ "key": "backlog_days_min", "value": "91" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Dashboard",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Dashboard bobot + backlog",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('dua blok: bobot + backlog', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.all.keys('bobot', 'backlog');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.bobot).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.backlog).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('empat bucket backlog tetap', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.backlog.map((b) => b.bucket)).to.eql(['1–30', '31–60', '61–90', '91+']);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.backlog[3].hari_max).to.eql(null);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('bobot 0..100 per tahun', () => {",
                  "    json.data.bobot.forEach((b) => {",
                  "        pm.expect(b.rata_rata_bobot).to.be.within(0, 100);",
                  "        pm.expect(b.total_data).to.be.above(0);",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/monitoring_memorandum/dashboard",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "monitoring_memorandum", "dashboard"]
            },
            "description": "Dashboard global — tidak dipengaruhi filter/search di halaman list. Bobot dirata-rata per `YEAR(tanggal_issue)`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
